<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the Spanish first division after Sunday's games.</p>
<p>12 -  Ronaldo (Barcelona)</p>
<p>9  -  Davor Suker (Real Madrid), Jose Ziganda (Athletic Bilbao)</p>
<p>8  -  Oli Alvarez (Oviedo), Predrag Mijatovic (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>7  -  Guilherme (Rayo Vallecano), Juan Eduardo Esnaider </p>
<p>(Atletico Madrid), Julen Guerrero (Athletic Bilbao)</p>
<p>6  -  Gustavo Poyet (Zaragoza), Alfonso Perez (Real Betis),</p>
<p>Salva Ballesta (Sevilla)</p>
